WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.729 --> 00:00:06.940
This is not good news and it could slow down
those really great vaccination numbers that

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:08.050
I just told you about.

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:15.099
U.S. regulators are now calling for a complete
and total pause on using the Johnson and Johnson

00:00:15.099 --> 00:00:22.449
coronavirus vaccine because of six blood clot
cases that have happened among six million

00:00:22.449 --> 00:00:26.410
people who have received the Johnson and Johnson
vaccine.

00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:32.400
So the first piece is that the FDA and the
CDC have already decided they will no longer

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:35.900
use the vaccine at federal vaccination sites.

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:38.629
They are urging states to also pause.

00:00:38.629 --> 00:00:41.300
And as far as I know, basically every state
is doing it.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:44.399
I know people who were scheduled to get their
JNJ shot today.

00:00:44.399 --> 00:00:46.150
Their appointment has been canceled.

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:52.370
What we know so far, per The New York Times,
is that six recipients in the US developed

00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:58.430
a really rare disorder that involves blood
clots within about two weeks of vaccination.

00:00:58.430 --> 00:01:03.920
It's six people, all women between the ages
of 18 and 48.

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:05.360
One woman died.

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:11.770
A second woman in Nebraska has been hospitalized
and is in critical condition nearly.

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:12.770
It's actually not six.

00:01:12.770 --> 00:01:19.150
It's nearly seven million people in the U.S.
have received the JNJ shot so far.

00:01:19.150 --> 00:01:23.640
Nine million more doses have been shipped
to states which presumably will just be held

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:24.700
for the time being.

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:31.290
Dr. Peter Marks, who directs the FDA's Center
for Biologics Evaluation and Research, put

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:37.010
out a statement along with the principal deputy
director of the CDC, Anne Schuchat, and they

00:01:37.010 --> 00:01:40.270
said, quote, We are recommending a pause in
the use of the vaccine out of an abundance

00:01:40.270 --> 00:01:41.290
of caution.

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:47.630
So let's talk the numbers through six incidents
out of about seven million vaccinations.

00:01:47.630 --> 00:01:54.390
The first question is, was this caused by
the vaccine or did these six individuals have

00:01:54.390 --> 00:02:01.340
some underlying disorder or abnormality that
was exacerbated by the vaccine?

00:02:01.340 --> 00:02:07.200
Other questions that are being looked at include,
given that we're talking about all six of

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:10.959
the individuals were women age 18 to 48.

00:02:10.959 --> 00:02:13.879
Could this be connected to some kind of medication,
for example?

00:02:13.879 --> 00:02:15.290
And this is just an example.

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:18.590
There's no evidence of this, but this is the
type of question that's being asked.

00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:23.909
If all six of these women were on oral contraceptives,
the birth control pill, that would be something

00:02:23.909 --> 00:02:24.909
to look at.

00:02:24.909 --> 00:02:25.909
We just don't know yet.

00:02:25.909 --> 00:02:30.520
And while it's been while it's being investigated,
it's going to be a setback in the vaccination

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:32.549
program.

00:02:32.549 --> 00:02:36.549
Everybody is being clear right now that there
is not a causal relationship here, but it

00:02:36.549 --> 00:02:37.769
has to be investigated.

00:02:37.769 --> 00:02:43.849
In the U.S., somewhere between 300000 and
600000 people per year develop blood clots

00:02:43.849 --> 00:02:47.470
generally, but not this particular kind of
blood clot.

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:50.379
This is a cerebral venous sinus thrombosis.

00:02:50.379 --> 00:02:52.420
It's very, very rare.

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:53.840
And we have to do it safely.

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:56.549
That has to be priority number one.

00:02:56.549 --> 00:02:59.889
We also have to make sure that this is reported
on in a responsible way.

00:02:59.889 --> 00:03:02.579
You know what's going to be on Fox News tonight?

00:03:02.579 --> 00:03:06.000
The anti vaccines are already saying, see,
we were right about all of it.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:13.019
Well, no, you the same people said MRSA vaccines
are really, really dangerous.

00:03:13.019 --> 00:03:18.170
And it actually it's been the two adenovirus
vaccines that we are seeing, this blood clot

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:23.359
issue with the JMJ vaccine here in the U.S.,
AstraZeneca, in Europe and in other places.

00:03:23.359 --> 00:03:29.959
Remember that out of 34 million people who
received the AstraZeneca vaccine in Britain,

00:03:29.959 --> 00:03:37.340
as well as the EU and and three other countries,
there were 222 of these blood clot incidents

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:39.529
linked with a low platelet level.

00:03:39.529 --> 00:03:42.889
So slightly different situation.

00:03:42.889 --> 00:03:47.920
It's it's been the adenovirus vaccines where
we've seen this, not the marnay.

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:52.180
And so when the same people that we're talking
about MRSA come forward and say all of these

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:57.319
vaccines are unsafe, let's let's not allow
them to to get Galab us.

00:03:57.319 --> 00:04:02.139
Let's talk now about the effect on just the
vaccination program in the United States with

00:04:02.139 --> 00:04:09.801
the JMJ doses, we were expecting to have enough
for all 260 million adults in the U.S. by

00:04:09.801 --> 00:04:11.629
the end of next month, by the end of May.

00:04:11.629 --> 00:04:14.530
Didn't mean everybody would have received
their shots by then, but there would be enough

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:16.350
support.

00:04:16.350 --> 00:04:21.590
Without the Johnson and Johnson doses, most
adults, there would be enough supply for two

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:23.140
hundred and thirty million adults.

00:04:23.140 --> 00:04:26.360
That's not everybody, that's not all 260 million.

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:32.030
But so many people are refusing to get the
vaccine that in practice, even without the

00:04:32.030 --> 00:04:38.800
JMJ doses, there very well could still be
enough doses for every adult who wants the

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:41.290
vaccine to get one.

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:44.070
And that supply would be available by the
end of May.

00:04:44.070 --> 00:04:48.510
So we could be depending on how many people
want the vaccine.

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:50.260
This could be a delay of a few weeks.

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:54.220
And getting to where we hope to get it could
be a delay of a couple of months.

00:04:54.220 --> 00:05:02.510
There are other countries that are so dependent
on future doses of the JMJ vaccine that if

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:07.970
this doesn't get resolved in a way that it's
deemed to be safe and the JMJ vaccination

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:13.950
continues, it could really be a disaster for
the plans of of of some other countries.

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:18.740
The vaccine might also come back online relatively
quickly, but with some demographic restrictions.

00:05:18.740 --> 00:05:26.690
If we can determine that there's something
about why it's only affected six women, do

00:05:26.690 --> 00:05:31.180
you say, well, we're bringing it back online,
but only men should get the JMJ vaccine?

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:35.060
This is idle speculation, but these are the
things medical regulators are going to be

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:36.060
looking at.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:39.340
So not the news that we wanted.

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:43.800
We continue vaccinating with the Pfizer and
the Moderna vaccines.

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:46.190
Deaths are continuing down.

00:05:46.190 --> 00:05:47.280
Cases are level.

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:54.020
And if we can trace the variants successfully,
cases should be significantly lower in about

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:55.840
a month.

00:05:55.840 --> 00:06:00.030
And we will continue following what happens
with the JMJ vaccine, as well as other distribution

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:02.910
cases, variants and all of that.

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:07.410
Let me know your thoughts if you've received
the JMJ vaccine already, but you're within

00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:12.820
the two week period during which these reactions
are happening, are you worried or are the

00:06:12.820 --> 00:06:16.010
numbers so low that it doesn't concern you?

00:06:16.010 --> 00:06:17.010
Let me know.

00:06:17.010 --> 00:07:20.449
I'm on Twitter at David Pakman.

